#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:27
msgid "Data entry."
msgstr "Ange data."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:30
msgid ""
"Before a graph can be created, the data must be entered into a workbook."
msgstr "Innan du skapar ett diagram måste du ange data i en arbetsbok."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:37
msgid "(Optional) Data pre-selection."
msgstr "(Valfritt) Markera data i förväg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:40
msgid ""
"As explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-preselect\"/>, it is possible to"
" pre-select the data and have <application>Gnumeric</application> correctly "
"assign the cell contents into series names, category labels and data values."
" This process can only be understood once the rest of the graph creation "
"process has been mastered so the discussion of pre-selecting data is left "
"until the end of this section."
msgstr ""
"Som beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-preselect\"/> kan du markera data"
" i förväg. Då tilldelar <application>Gnumeric</application> cellinnehållet "
"korrekt till serienamn, kategorietiketter och datavärden. Det är lättare att"
" förstå detta när du behärskar de övriga stegen i diagramarbetet, så "
"avsnittet om förhandsmarkering kommer sist."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:53
msgid "Opening the graph guru"
msgstr "Öppna diagramguiden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:56
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph Guru</interface> can be opened in two ways. It can be "
"opened by clicking on the <guibutton>Graph Guru</guibutton> button, "
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-"
"graph.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the toolbar "
"graph guru button.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>, which is on "
"the standard toolbar immediately to the left of the zoom box. Alternatively "
"the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> can be opened by using, in the "
"<guimenu>Insert</guimenu> menu, the <guimenuitem>Chart</guimenuitem> menu "
"item."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> kan öppnas på två sätt. Klicka på "
"knappen <guibutton>Diagramguiden</guibutton> <inlinemediaobject> "
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/button-graph.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av knappen för diagramguiden i "
"verktygsfältet.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject>, som finns i "
"standardverktygsfältet direkt till vänster om zoomrutan. Du kan också öppna "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> genom att öppna menyn "
"<guimenu>Infoga</guimenu> och välja menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Diagram</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:76
msgid "Configuring the graph"
msgstr "Konfigurera diagrammet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:79
msgid ""
"The <interface>Graph Guru</interface> provides the user with a large number "
"of options to configure the graph, its charts and the plots. The first panel"
" provides a way to select the plot type, sub-type and, for some types, a "
"style. The second panel allows the user to configure each element of the "
"graph. When the configuration is complete, the guru is dismissed by clicking"
" the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button. This step will be explained in detail"
" in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-graphguru-navigating\"/>, below."
msgstr ""
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> har många alternativ för att "
"konfigurera diagrammet, dess deldiagram och diagramtyper. I den första "
"panelen väljer du diagramtyp och undertyp samt, för vissa typer, en stil. I "
"den andra panelen konfigurerar du diagrammets olika delar. När du är klar "
"stänger du guiden genom att klicka på <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. Detta steg "
"beskrivs närmare i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-graphguru-navigating\"/> "
"nedan."
